WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.768
The Resources tab holds your prayer list, your church's sermons, and your sermon notes.

00:00:05.768 --> 00:00:07.262
Let's start with prayer.

00:00:08.064 --> 00:00:10.430
Write down what's on your heart today.

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:13.419
Type it, or tap the microphone and simply speak.

00:00:13.419 --> 00:00:17.280
Press enter to start a new line, and tap Add when you're done.

00:00:18.082 --> 00:00:21.260
For the people you pray for every week, tick Repeat.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:25.293
You can choose the days, and those prayers come back on their own.

00:00:26.093 --> 00:00:31.768
Add an encouraging verse by typing its reference, or let the app suggest one for you.

00:00:32.569 --> 00:00:34.804
When God answers a prayer, tick it.

00:00:34.804 --> 00:00:41.572
It's kept in your answered prayers, a record of His faithfulness, with room to write down how He answered.
